        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 22:50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yehoshafaati yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaazikwa hamwe nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi; Yehoraamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba aine abarumuna, abaana ba Yehoshafaati, Azaria, Yehieli, Zekaria, Azaria, Mikaeli na Shefatia; abo boona bakaba bari batabani ba Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishebo akabaha ebiconco bingi, by'efeeza, n'ezaabu n'ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi hamwe n'endembo omuri Yuda ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare; kwonka obugabe yaabuha Yehoraamu, ahabw'okuba omwana w'omujigaijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoraamu ku yaagiire aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa ishe, yaahamibwa, yaita abarumuna boona na rurara, n'abandi banyiginya b'omuri Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.8.17+2KI.8.18+2KI.8.19+2KI.8.20+2KI.8.21+2KI.8.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 8:17-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yehoraamu akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ashatu n'ebiri, obu yaaza aha ngoma, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka munaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28+1KI.12.29+1KI.12.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 12:28-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.31+1KI.16.32+1KI.16.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:31-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.8.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 8:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaagyendera omu mihanda y'abagabe ba Israeli, nk'ab'enju ya Ahabu ashweire muhara wa Ahabu. Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 11:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'obu biraabe byabaire biri bityo, MUKAMA akanga kucwekyerereza kimwe enju ya Daudi, ahabw'endagaano ei yaaragaine na Daudi, n'ahabw'okumuraganisa we n'oruzaaro rwe, kubaha etabaaza ebiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro bye Abanyaedomu bakagoma, baaruga omu butegyeki bwa Yuda, baayeteeraho owaabo mugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yehoraamu yaayambuka n'abakuru b'engabo n'ebigaari bye byona; yaimuka nyekiro, yaateera Abanyaedomu, abaabaire bamwehinguririize n'abakuru b'ebigaari bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo Edomu yaagomire, ekaruga omu butegyeki bwa Yuda n'okuhitsya hati. Omu bunaku obwo Libuna nayo yaamugomera, ahabw'okuba akaba atsigireho MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
