          "text": " Ebiro ku byahingwireho, aha muheru gw'emyaka ebiri, yaatandika kureeta omwoyo ahabw'egyo ndwara, yaafa aine obuhuruzi bwingi munonga. Abantu be tibaacumika muriro gw'okumuhaisa ekitiinisa, nk'oku baagiriire baishenkuru. ",
